2423,"sku":"Heets Creations Apricity - Carton","price":5450.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/HEETS_CREATIONS_APRICITY.jpg?v=1747872792"},{"product_id":"heets-gold-label","title":"IQOS HEETS Gold Label","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"short-description\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eGold Selection Label IQOS HEETS Gold Selection (previously known as Gold Label) flavor has strong tobacco flavour with a taste almost heavy as cigars. For use only with IQOS devices. Buy Heets in Kenya at your doorstep.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"short-description\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis carton contains 10 packs of HEETS tobacco sticks. Each pack contains 20 sticks, for a total of 200 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIQOS HEETS are real tobacco sticks made for IQOS 'Heat Not Burn' products.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"1 PACK","offer_id":41700846862391,"sku":"Heets Gold Label - Pack","price":590.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41700846895159,"sku":"Heets Gold Label - Carton","price":5000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/heets-gold.jpg?v=1749517844"},{"product_id":"iqos-heets-creations-twilight","title":"IQOS HEETS Creations Twilight","description":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThis carton contains 10 packs of HEETS tobacco sticks. Each pack contains 20 sticks, for a total of 200 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eIQOS HEETS are real tobacco sticks made for IQOS 'Heat Not Burn' products.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHeets Creations Twilight sticks with wild berry flavored capsule and woody notes for the Iqos tobacco heating system.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eEach HEETS stick contains 0.